-- capitec-bank-muizenberg (owner)
UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Capitec Bank''s Muizenberg branch is at Shop 21 in Capricorn Square, on the corner of Prince George Drive and Dury Road. The branch serves local residents, shoppers and small business owners from Muizenberg, Lavender Hill, Capricorn and the surrounding area, with a focus on simple, affordable banking.

Customers can open and manage transactional accounts, set up savings accounts, apply for personal credit and ask about the bank''s insurance products. Consultants at the branch help with tasks such as opening an account, replacing a card, updating personal details and getting set up on the banking app, while self-service terminals let customers handle quick transactions without waiting in a queue. The branch is a practical stop for anyone who prefers to sort out their finances face to face or needs help with something that cannot be done on a phone. Its spot inside Capricorn Square means banking can be combined with grocery shopping and other errands at the centre. Capitec Bank is at Shop 21, Capricorn Square, corner of Prince George Drive and Dury Road, Muizenberg, Cape Town.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'capitec-bank-muizenberg' AND description = 'Capitec Bank is a bank branch inside Capricorn Square, offering everyday banking services to shoppers in Muizenberg.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
