-- connie-s-pawn-shop-brooklyn (owner)
UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Connie''s Pawn Shop is a pawnbroker at 249 Koeberg Road in Brooklyn, Cape Town, offering short-term cash loans secured against personal valuables. For people who need money quickly and would rather not go through a lengthy credit application, pawning an item is a straightforward option: the item is valued, a loan is offered against it, and it is returned once the loan is repaid.

The shop accepts a wide range of goods as security, including gold jewellery, electronics, power tools and household appliances. Each item is assessed before a loan amount is agreed, and transactions are handled privately so customers can borrow with discretion. Alongside its pawn loans, the shop also sells pre-owned goods, which gives bargain hunters a chance to pick up tools, electronics and other everyday items for less than the price of buying new. Its spot on Koeberg Road, one of the main routes through Brooklyn, makes it easy to reach from Maitland, Rugby and the surrounding suburbs. Connie''s Pawn Shop is at 249 Koeberg Road, Brooklyn, Cape Town.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'connie-s-pawn-shop-brooklyn' AND description = 'Connie''s Pawn Shop is a pawnbroker offering pawn loans against items such as jewellery and electronics, in Brooklyn.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
