Shoppers will find fresh fruit and vegetables, including organic options, along with quality meat cuts, chilled dairy and bakery items baked for the shelves each day. A good selection of ready-made meals, salads and snacks makes it easy to put together a beach picnic or an easy dinner after a day in the sun, while pantry staples and household basics cover the weekly shop. Visitors staying in holiday apartments and guesthouses nearby often use the store to fill the fridge on arrival. Its spot on Victoria Road, among the restaurants and cafés facing the beach, means a quick grocery stop fits easily into a day out in Camps Bay. Woolworths is at Shop 202, The Promenade, 87 Victoria Road, Camps Bay, Cape Town.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'woolworths-the-promenade-camps-bay' AND description = 'Woolworths is a supermarket and general retailer in The Promenade, Camps Bay, part of the national Woolworths chain.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
