At the pharmacy counter, customers can have prescriptions filled and get advice from the pharmacy team on medicines and minor ailments. The store''s clinic offers health services such as basic health checks and immunisations, which saves a separate trip for routine care. Beyond the dispensary, the shelves carry cosmetics, skincare and haircare, personal care products, vitamins, baby essentials and a range of small homeware items. That mix makes it easy to collect a prescription and pick up toiletries or nappies in the same visit, whether on a lunch break or after work. Clicks Pharmacy Montague Gardens is at Shop 1, John Montague Centre, 19 Montague Drive, Montague Gardens, Cape Town.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'clicks-pharmacy-montague-gardens-montague-gardens' AND description = 'Clicks Pharmacy Montague Gardens is a pharmacy and retail health store inside John Montague Centre, Montague Gardens.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
