The menu is built around Original Recipe chicken, sold as individual pieces, meals and family buckets for sharing. Alongside the chicken, customers can order burgers, wraps such as the Twister, golden chips and sides, with Krushers and cold drinks to go with a meal. Orders can be eaten in or taken away, which makes the branch a handy option for a quick lunch while shopping or a ready-made supper on the way home. Family buckets are a popular choice for weekend gatherings, birthdays and get-togethers where several people need feeding at once. Its spot at one of Mandela Park''s busy intersections keeps it easy to reach on foot or by taxi. KFC Khaya Corner is at Khaya Corner, corner of Govan Mbeki and Oscar Mpetha Roads, Mandela Park, Khayelitsha, Cape Town.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'kfc-khaya-corner-mandela-park' AND description = 'KFC Khaya Corner is a fast-food and takeaway restaurant at Khaya Corner shopping centre in Mandela Park, Khayelitsha.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
