Shoppers can browse current smartphones, tablets, Wi-Fi routers and mobile accessories such as chargers, cases and earphones. Consultants help customers compare contract deals, apply for a new line, upgrade an existing device or move to a different package, and they can also set up prepaid airtime and data bundles. For home and small office users, the store can advise on mobile and fixed wireless internet options that suit different budgets and usage. When a phone or SIM gives trouble, staff can help with SIM swaps, settings and basic troubleshooting, which often saves a long call to customer care. Being in a neighbourhood shopping centre makes it easy to sort out a phone or data issue alongside other errands. MTN Steenberg Village is at Shop 7, Steenberg Village Shopping Centre, Reddam Avenue, Tokai, Cape Town.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'mtn-steenberg-village-tokai' AND description = 'MTN Steenberg Village is a mobile phone and network services store inside Steenberg Village shopping centre in Tokai.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
