The pharmacists dispense prescriptions and chronic medication and give advice on over-the-counter treatments for everyday ailments. The resident nurse runs clinic consultations, including health screenings and general medical advice, which is useful for routine checks without booking a doctor''s appointment. The skincare specialist helps customers choose products for their skin type and concerns, from daily care to targeted treatments. On the shelves, shoppers will find a considered selection of vitamins and supplements, quality cosmetics and skincare ranges, and personal care items for daily use. The pharmacy''s smaller, neighbourhood feel means staff get to know regular customers and can offer more personal attention. Bantry Bay Pharmacy is at 29 Victoria Road, Bantry Bay, Cape Town.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'bantry-bay-pharmacy-bantry-bay' AND description = 'Bantry Bay Pharmacy is a retail pharmacy with pharmacists, a skin care specialist and a resident nurse, in Bantry Bay.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
